          "name": "Staff Knowledge & Skills",
          "description": "Workforce capability, training, and culture for AI"
        },
        {
          "id": "jisc-tech",
          "name": "Technology & Infrastructure",
          "description": "Technical infrastructure, systems, and data for AI deployment"
        }
      ],
      "stages": [
        "Approaching & Understanding",
        "Experimenting & Exploring",
        "Operational",
        "Embedded",
        "Optimised/Transformed"
      ],
      "level_alignment_notes": "THE uses 4 levels; JISC uses 5 stages. Approximate alignment: THE Incidental ~ JISC Approaching; THE Intentional ~ JISC Experimenting/Exploring; THE Integrated ~ JISC Operational/Embedded; THE Optimised ~ JISC Optimised/Transformed. The alignment is imprecise because THE assesses broad digital maturity while JISC is AI-specific."
    },
